{
 "id": "MOD_ShadowMagus",
 "name": "Shadow Magus",
 "description": "Mages of what the light leaves out. A Shadow Magus never hides: it takes the enemy's eyes instead, and keeps its own.\n\nSpells put Benighted on enemies, which dims their aim and their footing. Every critical hit sharpens your Darkvision, and crits on Benighted enemies spread the dark or finish them outright. Shadowflame and your own Shade pool dark that enemies lose you in, Lose Them scatters a room blind, Swallowed shrinks one into the dark, and The Thing in the Dark is exactly what it sounds like. Damage scales with [REC] and [PSI]; how surely the dark takes hold scales with [REC] alone.",
 "archetype": "Guile",
 "icon": "icons/shadow_magus.png",
 "iconFrom": "SKILLTREE_VoidPsyker",
 "attributePriorities": {
  "PsiPower": 4,
  "Recognition": 4,
  "Agility": 1
 },
